    title: "js/ts: the namespace-import path_hint does not override the bare-name symbol table, so `import * as u from './a_early/utils'; u.process()` binds to whichever same-named function was indexed last in directory-enumeration order"  # 0763
    status: todo_hard  # 0763
    priority: 2  # 0763
    parent:  # 0763
    tags:  # 0763
    - javascript  # 0763
    - analysis_quality  # 0763
